cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: "service-behaviour: what a body does, and how it moves"
abstract: >
  A service: the packing of the planner and the motion interactor into one
  deployable thing. It holds no code of its own. The two exchange intents and
  poses through a ring, which forces co-location, and they stay two rather than
  one because a plan changes in seconds and a pose changes every tick.
